    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Corsair Coterie",
    "summary": "Whenever an enemy unit finishes a [Charge move](vsdata:core-rule/charge-move), [Fall Back](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back), [Advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) or [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move) in an [objective marker](vsdata:core-rule/objectives)'s range while you control that marker, roll a D6: on a 2+, the enemy unit takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds).\n\nYour **ANHRATHE** units get this ability:\n\n**Void Thieves**: as a phase ends, each objective marker under your control whose range this unit is in stays yours until, as a phase ends, the [Level of Control](vsdata:core-rule/level-of-control) your opponent has over it is higher than yours.",
